sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>DesignerProfilePage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewDesignerProfileBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewDesignerProfileController
  participant DesignerProfile as «entity»<br/>DesignerProfile
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: view my designer profile
  UI->>B: GET /api/designer/profile (JWT)
  B->>C: view(Integer designerId)
  C->>DesignerProfile: findByDesigner()
  DesignerProfile->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>DesignerProfile: rows
  DesignerProfile-->>C: result
  C-->>B: DesignerProfileResponse
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result